{
    "chapter_num": 2,
    "verses_count": 17,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Great Apostasy"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now, brethren, concerning the coming of our Lord Jesus Christ and our gathering together to Him, we ask you, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "not to be soon shaken in mind or troubled, either by spirit or by word or by letter, as if from us, as though the day of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU the Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Christ had come. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let no one deceive you by any means; for "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that Day will not come"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " unless the falling away comes first, and the man of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU lawlessness"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "sin is revealed, the son of perdition, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "who opposes and exalts himself above all that is called God or that is worshiped, so that he sits "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits as God"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "as God in the temple of God, showing himself that he is God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do you not remember that when I was still with you I told you these things? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And now you know what is restraining, that he may be revealed in his own time. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "hidden truth"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "mystery of lawlessness is already at work; only "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or he"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He who now restrains "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "will do so"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " until He is taken out of the way. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And then the lawless one will be revealed, whom the Lord will consume with the breath of His mouth and destroy with the brightness of His coming. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The coming of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "lawless one"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " is according to the working of Satan, with all power, signs, and lying wonders, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and with all unrighteous deception among those who perish, because they did not receive the love of the truth, that they might be saved. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And for this reason God will send them strong delusion, that they should believe the lie, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that they all may be condemned who did not believe the truth but had pleasure in unrighteousness."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Stand Fast"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But we are "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "under obligation"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "bound to give thanks to God always for you, brethren beloved by the Lord, because God from the beginning chose you for salvation through "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "being set apart by"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "sanctification by the Spirit and belief in the truth, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to which He called you by our gospel, for the obtaining of the glory of our Lord Jesus Christ. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, brethren, stand fast and hold the traditions which you were taught, whether by word or our "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "letter"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "epistle."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now may our Lord Jesus Christ Himself, and our God and Father, who has loved us and given "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "us"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " everlasting consolation and good hope by grace, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "comfort your hearts and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "strengthen"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "establish you in every good word and work."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}